Package: pulzr-io
Provides: parkeze-io
Replaces: parkeze-io
Conflicts: parkeze-io
Depends: pulzr-base, ucode, ucode-mod-uci, ucode-mod-fs
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
Architecture: all
Description: Front-panel LEDs and buttons.
 Maps logical indicators — power, status, lora, cloud, cellular — onto whatever
 LEDs a board actually has, and drives them from real system state. Handles the
 reset button, including the held-down factory reset.
